# In-game pause menu (Escape, when saving is possible): the box window itself is a 480 x 380 dialog centred on a 40%
# scrim with the commands as a column of menu buttons, in the original order. The logo window (WinLoad) is not shown
# here; the dialog has no art. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
scrim
window $QuitMenuParent centre middle 0 0 480 380 dialog
hide $WinLoad
stack centre top 0 382 440 14
  item $ButtonSaveLoad 52 menu
  item $ButtonOptions 52 menu
  item $ButtonRestart 52 menu
  item $ButtonExit 52 menu
  item $ButtonReturn 52 menu
end
